<title>FRANCE: Foreign exchange parities in Europe right - Arthuis.</title>
<headline>Foreign exchange parities in Europe right - Arthuis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday that current foreign exchange parities in the European Union were at the right level, Government Spokesman Alain Lamassoure told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;Jean Arthuis told the cabinet that the foreign exchange parities in the European Union were the right ones,&quot; Lamassoure told a news conference after the weekly cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no reason to touch the parity of the franc,&quot; Lamassoure said Arthuis added.</p>
</text>
